{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "b536ddd1fae5af86f923c9d60a22a62ace4d1d327491e2b4c64e0ce32deece4c", "ja": "プロデュースします！", "zh": "交给ROCO来企划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "385113f1745e409a4b4cd287b4f52d618c402f2ebf8e804e97dc7663ae644968", "ja": "新ユニットのメンバーやコンセプトを一任\nされたプロデューサー。方向性に悩みつつ昴\nとロコをユニットに誘う。ロコの「今回の新\nユニットをプロデュースしてみたい」との\n発言から、ひとまず任せてみる事になった。", "zh": "制作人被授权全权处理新团体的成员及主题。\n他为了团体路线而烦恼不已，\n同时也找了昴和ROCO来加入团体。\n由于ROCO说她想企划这次的新团体，\n于是制作人便决定先交给她处理看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b873c4362789c651089a1d43572a6fbf23a819d1741ad3022724536c07c9c52a", "ja": "（自由にやっていいと言われると、逆に悩んでしまう\nものなんだな。うーん、自由って難しい……）", "zh": "（听到可以自由发挥，反而很让人伤脑筋呢。\n嗯～所谓的自由还真难……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "78da2a1f6666cc621898bafff67138bd16e252a4975eb2fdd82c08d8e24ff78a", "ja": "ストリートアートをフォービズム的に解釈すれば……\nテキスタイルデザインと合わせて……ブツブツ……。", "zh": "要用Fauvisme来诠释Street art的话……\n结合Textile design……（自言自语）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "afac6a0eae65244a8c1e3c7f5a6f0e148102b2865880814746214cccc189947a", "ja": "はっ！　わかりました！\nマカロニ・ウェスタンをバックグラウンドにして……。", "zh": "啊！ROCO知道了！\n把Spaghetti Western当作是Background……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "8ccfe892802b78017552b6030bb8d4a644cee5a92ed05b4cc580f6287e8d7be8", "ja": "なーロコ。これホントにアートなの？　オレには\n折れたハンガーと布切れにしか見えないんだけど。", "zh": "我说ROCO，这真的是艺术品吗？\n在我看起来就只是弯掉的衣架和碎布而已啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "b5f2fc732d3c42a4d376ecc0f5e8f2d6b80a060effa7b12d742ac12a3d520b35", "ja": "わーっ！　スバル、ドントタッチです～っ！", "zh": "哇──！昴，Don't touch啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "a60d9aa792252f35692fe3416e315b1409aafe055126778b031944e83deca9fd", "ja": "それはロコのモーストリーセントワーク、\n『カーニバルのエクリチュール』です！", "zh": "那是ROCO的Most recent work\n『Carnival之书写』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9383d70ca8f41a0b85943f386858a7e72ccf12d2f6de1a4497ac3ede23f8d41", "ja": "カニ……えっと、何？", "zh": "Carni……呃，你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "9fffb1a1fda434541c24bef7378cb684761fe7b157d6a8330b7ab12d66bbf3f4", "ja": "『カーニバルのエクリチュール』です！\n人々の抱えるタイクツをエクスプレッションして……。", "zh": "『Carnival之书写』啊！\n这是将人们所怀的闲闲无事进行Expression……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "185239e5f6b234bd23cd864731485cd2768c8986e0a25f905946d899e9424ff1", "ja": "あーっ、破れた。", "zh": "啊，破掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "e3daf8930cde4d67ceb04146ffb4156db7a6cf366094e9a3707412cdf950a99a", "ja": "破っちゃダメです～っ！", "zh": "不可以弄破啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "0024af46da3d86c404ac33db88f008fdae436d5fb006280cb0bde9193b1354a0", "ja": "えーっ、だってもうビリビリに破れてるじゃん。", "zh": "咦～可是本来就已经破得差不多了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "2c371a5a57439fe58001ce94612e5eb073bcdd388c865bd70a8e546d4101ce8d", "ja": "ライトとダークのコントラストがアプリシエーションの\nインパクトをフィックスするんです～！ ううっ……。", "zh": "Light和Dark的Contrast，可以Fix出\nAppreciation的impact啊～！呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "b4ba55e23765bd8abe8ebe3daec731aced159c2997d15daff23fa8a069bc8254", "ja": "う～、わかんないけど、わかったよ。\nごめんな、ロコ。直せばいいのか？", "zh": "呜～虽然听不懂，但我知道了。\n抱歉，ROCO。我应该要修好它吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "b3e0a485ddbfc16da4a2d7382dd1df3fe32cd10148bc9b2756e547d29bb43106", "ja": "むむ……待ってください！\nあえてコントラストをディストラクトすることで……。", "zh": "唔唔……等等！\n故意把Contrast给Distract就可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "d84af6a9a0d65d4f193ad355610ad7d38c0fed25b20055ab8c19a8f8885c230a", "ja": "スバルのおかげで新しいシナジーが生まれそうです！\nこのままでいきましょう♪", "zh": "多亏昴的福，好像产生出新的Synergy了！\n就这样继续做下去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "a3c56ec71143e01ec2e82af4b9a57fb824532d9cf5c608740e9dc7800c0f4983", "ja": "ん？　直さなくていいの？\nよくわかんないけど、一段落したら野球行こうぜー。", "zh": "嗯？不用修理没关系吗？\n虽然搞不太清楚，总之告一段落后我们就去打棒球吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ff13a0f5eedf978d1f52eecafe44b7caefb9cecde0c46f39467dee7dc1eaeb93", "ja": "（仲良さそうにしているな。声をかけてみるか）", "zh": "（她们看起来相处得很融洽呢，向她们搭话看看好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "07d8714af2f01423e42dfd402e467a2f3511aba640e5cae8b9946b7c568ed69f", "ja": "ロコ、昴！　お腹空いてないか？\n青羽さんからもらった駄菓子があるんだ。", "zh": "ROCO、昴！你们会不会饿？\n我这里有一些青羽小姐给的零嘴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "23845d4e719c5eb9be7c975fe011acd07f751f4671c5d974af4e7ddfac97cc04", "ja": "えっ、駄菓子？　やったー！\nなんかコバラがすいたとこだったんだよな。", "zh": "咦，零嘴？太棒了～！\n我才刚觉得肚子有点小饿呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "5f43e00c1547fa3e5d7a4a70581691496365e8046e188ed085e76af0a8d23405", "ja": "{$P$}、サンクスです♪\n集中した後には甘いものが一番ですから！", "zh": "{$P$}，Thanks♪\n刚集中精神完，还是吃甜食最棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "9ebe949526d2d83ebfb2b23e11ee2c536b7b0b743e240b80a8cb8e1aedb6a627", "ja": "あ、そういえば、また社長が\n{$P$}のこと探してたらしいぜ。", "zh": "啊，这么说来，\n社长好像又在找{$P$}了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "34f3be24694c31af2f01c06a2d3bfda09481022ed59371a8eef6a2f067e7f07d", "ja": "ああ。その用事なら今済ませてきたよ。\n新しいユニットの話だったんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，我刚才去找他讲完事情了。\n他是要找我谈新团体的事啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "86ac595d1569964c69e0bcc0c0e3fe1fdd657a6bc80a6c37cc062c2df9edc21e", "ja": "へえ、そうなんだ？\n最近、すっげーいろんなユニットができてるよな！", "zh": "咦～是喔？\n最近新出了超多不同的团体呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "49d72ad63d5e47a60c87925192e0aa1c7874808908538582b8a69c58a43969c3", "ja": "今度は、どんなコンセプトのユニットなんですか？\nロコでよければ、アドバイスしますよ♪", "zh": "这次是什么主题的团体呢？\n需要的话ROCO可以给你建议喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f752428c32648dafe43ba73b6b9f41b876738c62f1d182ce0c568208612dd36f", "ja": "それが、まだ決まってないんだよ。", "zh": "关于这点啊，其实还没有决定好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "f864638900056c1c0b85c5c561bc1b0fe174bddb48edddb7d72ad071228fbc55", "ja": "え？　でも、雰囲気っていうか……\n誰がメンバーで何人組で～、とかは？", "zh": "咦？可是风格之类的……\n成员有谁或是几人一组～这些有决定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "35e2d06c68e75c0b80a229c950b3a812bc165aeaa1bc82a6fe0fdb96c4e95dd3", "ja": "それもなんだ。\n今回は自由にやってみろって、社長に言われて。", "zh": "都还没有定案。\n社长说这次就让我自由发挥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "8a9b924f57b24e3f2b867f32c8ac135f915925026a50a2f9bea4519d484acbc1", "ja": "そっかー。丸投げってヤツだな！", "zh": "是喔～也就是全都丢给你想了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c77f9511f94cdb0d9bcbbde765c9d0348800b08f56af6e8a2393be3cedc618ea", "ja": "ま、まあ、信頼されてる……ってことかな。", "zh": "呃，也代表他很信任我……应该吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "6753e016a3b54ab880b16c5ad600638a42c17f7253813dcdb3029290a7f791e3", "ja": "で、どうすんの？　えへへっ、なんならオレが\nユニットのメンバーになってやるぜ！　なんてな♪", "zh": "那你要怎么办啊？嘿嘿，不然我来当\n新团体的成员好了！开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ae84683d0889a8a99e2da511034117c417b60cfc41e413349abed06ac6ae0e21", "ja": "……そうだな。メンバーから決めていくのも\nいいかもしれない。", "zh": "……好啊。\n先从成员开始决定好像也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "9ee0c0d97c2a4966c54d4e7ab811893b75374fc8ffc3ab40a4fdf5da13153ce7", "ja": "えっ！？\n{$P$}、マジで言ってんの？", "zh": "咦！？\n{$P$}，你是认真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "54d113e49f93b241622da1890eaf8bdf8a5e49a4819af870cac035ec171ad476", "ja": "ロコも一緒にどうだ？　二人は仲がいいし、\n面白いユニットになりそうじゃないか？", "zh": "ROCO要不要也一起加入啊？\n你们两个感情很好，感觉会组出有趣的团体呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1034_025roc", "source_sha256": "dbe7872d9e2990c0d4283e1edcb4ed5f36baf97851a35adf086493669118c346", "ja": "{$P$}、本当ですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}，你说真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1035_047sub", "source_sha256": "880239349445b665c5252843ed9790add0c14726691aa6efcf9a226b4acf7933", "ja": "……うわ～、マジかよ。自分で言っといてなんだけど、\nなんかオレ……、緊張してきたかも！", "zh": "……哇～真的假的啊。\n虽然是我自己先提议的，但我好像……开始紧张了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "c69978a5ae0829e5794d7e58c5c281d643c30ec51595511636597025ca46f8ae", "ja": "はは、さすがにまだ早いぞ？\nメンバーもコンセプトも、何も決まってないからな。", "zh": "哈哈，现在紧张还太早了吧？\n成员和主题什么的完全都还没想好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1037_047sub", "source_sha256": "c203fa9288dc157914a9520659e7705cd7fa82caa6381cf1546bff67e769a754", "ja": "あ、そっか。\nだよな、まだ何も決まってないよな～。", "zh": "啊，对耶。\n说的也是，什么都还没确定好嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_01_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "56151b2f49cbdd73685dd5c22d03c3d0357d53f5045efa2b6dc3fc610eefbba8", "ja": "スバルとユニット……。\nニューウェイブでアンノウンな……。", "zh": "和昴组团体……\n既New wave又Unknown的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
